From 406c10e10def764b2cddd7c4ae3bf73b3337bcc7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Omkar Chandorkar <gotenksIN@aospa.co>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 08:18:07 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] sigfm: Harden matching and template handling

Bound keypoint counts, descriptor dimensions, stream reads, and
geometric matching work. Serialize fixed-width little-endian fields
while retaining support for legacy templates and reporting errors.

Keep image extraction and completion in the private API. Align the
benchmark argument order with production matching, and register the
SIGFM tests with Meson.

Signed-off-by: Omkar Chandorkar <gotenksIN@aospa.co>
